  displayName: Banshee
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: de047cfabf6efac42a8c2f13a9490fab, type: 3}
  description: 'A banshee is a human-sized undead apparition, often appearing as
    a thin, drifting figure with hollow eyes. It has no wings, but still it moves
    with a mournful, slow float that glides through halls and ruins. Its defining
    feature is its voice: a piercing, soul-chilling screech that can be heard long
    before it is seen, echoing off stone and making the hair on your arms rise.'
